[{"id": "bf:fld/f/f001/f001.bf#NOW_CAMERA", "jp": "現在、カメラです。", "zh": "", "dup": null}, {"id": "bf:fld/f/f001/f001.bf#CHG_CAMERA", "jp": "次のカメラ前のカメラ", "zh": "", "dup": null}, {"id": "bf:fld/f/f001/f001.bf#EXITWARP", "jp": ">他のエリアに行きますか?", "zh": "", "dup": "dup:b942aa213957"}, {"id": "bf:fld/f/f001/f001.bf#EXITWARP_SEL", "jp": "はいいいえ", "zh": "", "dup": "dup:794ae24722fa"}, {"id": "bf:fld/f/f001/f001.bf#HOSEKI", "jp": ">異様な物体が浮いている。\n触れてみますか?", "zh": "", "dup": "dup:47750438ab12"}, {"id": "bf:fld/f/f001/f001.bf#HOSEKI_SEL", "jp": "はいいいえ", "zh": "", "dup": "dup:794ae24722fa"}, {"id": "bf:fld/f/f001/f001.bf#HOSEKI_NOGET", "jp": ">接触をあきらめた。", "zh": "", "dup": "dup:c2a6f84664a4"}, {"id": "bf:fld/f/f001/f001.bf#HOSEKI_GET", "jp": ">を個手に入れた。", "zh": "", "dup": "dup:1ddbe3462bd5"}, {"id": "bf:fld/f/f001/f001.bf#TAKARA", "jp": ">奇妙な物体が鎮座している。\n触れてみますか?", "zh": "", "dup": "dup:1f10fc7723c4"}, {"id": "bf:fld/f/f001/f001.bf#TAKARA_SEL", "jp": "はいいいえ", "zh": "", "dup": "dup:794ae24722fa"}, {"id": "bf:fld/f/f001/f001.bf#TAKARA_NOGET", "jp": ">接触をあきらめた。", "zh": "", "dup": "dup:c2a6f84664a4"}, {"id": "bf:fld/f/f001/f001.bf#TAKARA_STILLGET", "jp": ">何もおきない。", "zh": "", "dup": "dup:20afcfdb38cc"}, {"id": "bf:fld/f/f001/f001.bf#TAKARA_GET", "jp": ">を個手に入れた。", "zh": "", "dup": "dup:1ddbe3462bd5"}, {"id": "bf:fld/f/f001/f001.bf#TAKARA_GET2", "jp": ">を個手に入れた。\n>教会が探していると、噂の物質のようだ。\n<1727>と交換してくれるだろう。", "zh": "", "dup": "dup:2fe5618b8bd8"}, {"id": "bf:fld/f/f001/f001.bf#TAKARA_MAKA_GET", "jp": ">マッカ手に入れた。", "zh": "", "dup": "dup:ae4d99c30b1f"}, {"id": "bf:fld/f/f001/f001.bf#TAKARA_DAMAGE", "jp": ">サーフたちはダメージを受けた。", "zh": "", "dup": "dup:ab51c65780a1"}, {"id": "bf:fld/f/f001/f001.bf#TAKARA_DAMAGE_POISON", "jp": ">サーフたちはダメージを受け、\nさらに毒におかされた。", "zh": "", "dup": "dup:3b4648950d12"}, {"id": "bf:fld/f/f001/f001.bf#TAKARA_DAMAGE_ACHE", "jp": ">サーフたちはダメージを受け、\nさらにおなかを壊した。", "zh": "", "dup": "dup:36fec643ec65"}, {"id": "bf:fld/f/f001/f001.bf#TAKARA_DAMAGE_CLOSE", "jp": ">サーフたちはダメージを受け、\nさらに魔法を封じられた。", "zh": "", "dup": "dup:aaf374953e94"}, {"id": "bf:fld/f/f001/f001.bf#TAKARA_KARAGET", "jp": ">中身は空っぽだった。", "zh": "", "dup": "dup:2768675fb669"}, {"id": "bf:fld/f/f001/f001.bf#TAKARASAGASI", "jp": ">は、何かを見つけた。\n………\n>を個手に入れた。", "zh": "", "dup": "dup:93f0d3cff44a"}, {"id": "bf:fld/f/f001/f001.bf#COMP_OPENERROR", "jp": ">ここでは使えない。", "zh": "", "dup": "dup:5cecb7fdcab2"}, {"id": "bf:fld/f/f001/f001.bf#BAD_KAIFUKUSITAYO", "jp": ">ソーラーノイズの低下により、\nサーフ達の体から\nバッドステータスが消え去った。", "zh": "", "dup": "dup:f6a42097c9de"}, {"id": "bf:fld/f/f001/f001.bf#COMP_LIGHTMAEND", "jp": ">光の効果が切れた。", "zh": "", "dup": "dup:0ee7273eea20"}, {"id": "bf:fld/f/f001/f001.bf#COMP_ESTOMAEND", "jp": ">封魔の効果が切れた。", "zh": "", "dup": "dup:e54ea8d4589a"}, {"id": "bf:fld/f/f001/f001.bf#COMP_REBERAMAEND", "jp": ">集魔の効果が切れた。", "zh": "", "dup": "dup:f655249b0a19"}, {"id": "bf:fld/f/f001/f001.bf#COMP_REFUTOMAEND", "jp": ">浮き足の効果が切れた。", "zh": "", "dup": "dup:2a4bfae5b8c8"}, {"id": "bf:fld/f/f001/f001.bf#WARP_ELV_MSG", "jp": ">階数を選んで下さい。", "zh": "", "dup": "dup:7391190be71e"}, {"id": "bf:fld/f/f001/f001.bf#WARP_ELV_SEL1", "jp": " やめる", "zh": "", "dup": "dup:2b81edf23a17"}, {"id": "bf:fld/f/f001/f001.bf#WARP_ELV_SEL2", "jp": "  やめる", "zh": "", "dup": "dup:8c8c7c8c9d87"}, {"id": "bf:fld/f/f001/f001.bf#WARP_ELV_SEL3", "jp": "   やめる", "zh": "", "dup": "dup:89e9c9945efb"}, {"id": "bf:fld/f/f001/f001.bf#WARP_ELV_SEL4", "jp": "    やめる", "zh": "", "dup": "dup:e285e3624a25"}, {"id": "bf:fld/f/f001/f001.bf#WARP_ELV_SEL5", "jp": "     やめる", "zh": "", "dup": "dup:56f2ebfc886d"}, {"id": "bf:fld/f/f001/f001.bf#WARP_ELV_SEL6", "jp": "      やめる", "zh": "", "dup": "dup:86e58e6ec4a6"}, {"id": "bf:fld/f/f001/f001.bf#FLD_BLUEICE_KEYHAVE", "jp": ">不思議な青色の壁がある。\nブルーアイスキーで壊せそうだ。", "zh": "", "dup": "dup:27a6f3f357f0"}, {"id": "bf:fld/f/f001/f001.bf#FLD_REDICE_KEYHAVE", "jp": ">不思議な赤色の壁がある。\nレッドアイスキーで壊せそうだ。", "zh": "", "dup": "dup:8d51b7e90f21"}, {"id": "bf:fld/f/f001/f001.bf#FLD_YERWICE_KEYHAVE", "jp": ">不思議な黄色の壁がある。\nイエローアイスキーで壊せそうだ。", 